    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "name": "Ack Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        576
      ],
      "id": "21c6440b-4a58-4cba-ac29-8ae8188f2416",
      "notes": "لازم نرد 200 فورًا قبل أي معالجة. لو اتأخرنا Meta تعيد إرسال نفس الرسالة (لحد 36 ساعة).",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const value = $('Webhook').first().json.body?.entry?.[0]?.changes?.[0]?.value;\nif (!value?.messages?.length) return [];\n\nconst contacts = value.contacts ?? [];\nconst isBsuid = v => /^[A-Z]{2}\\./.test(v ?? '');   // BSUID looks like EG.1139891858712101\nconst MEDIA = ['image', 'audio', 'video', 'document', 'sticker'];\n\n// Meta can batch several messages in one webhook → one item per message\nreturn value.messages.map(msg => {\n  const contact = contacts.find(c => c.wa_id === msg.from || (c.user_id && c.user_id === msg.from_user_id)) ?? contacts[0];\n\n  const phone   = !isBsuid(msg.from) ? msg.from : (!isBsuid(contact?.wa_id) ? contact?.wa_id : null) ?? null;\n  const user_id = msg.from_user_id ?? contact?.user_id ?? (isBsuid(msg.from) ? msg.from : null);\n\n  const media = MEDIA.includes(msg.type) ? msg[msg.type] : null;\n  const loc   = msg.type === 'location' ? msg.location : null;\n\n  // what the user actually wrote (text body or media caption)\n  const content = msg.type === 'text' ? (msg.text?.body ?? null) : (media?.caption ?? null);\n\n  // type-specific extras → payload (jsonb)\n  let payload = null;\n  if (loc) payload = { latitude: loc.latitude, longitude: loc.longitude, name: loc.name ?? null, address: loc.address ?? null, maps_link: `https://www.google.com/maps?q=${loc.latitude},${loc.longitude}` };\n  if (msg.type === 'reaction') payload = { emoji: msg.reaction?.emoji ?? null, reacted_to: msg.reaction?.message_id ?? null };\n  if (msg.type === 'contacts') payload = { contacts: msg.contacts };\n  if (msg.type === 'audio') payload = { voice: msg.audio?.voice ?? null };\n\n  return { json: {\n    phone_number_id: value.metadata.phone_number_id,\n    phone, user_id,\n    reply_to: phone ?? user_id,            // always reply to this\n    username: contact?.profile?.username ?? null,\n    name: contact?.profile?.name ?? contact?.profile?.username ?? '',\n    message_id: msg.id,\n    timestamp: Number(msg.timestamp),\n    type: msg.type,\n    content,\n    caption: media?.caption ?? null,\n    button_reply: msg.button?.payload ?? msg.interactive?.button_reply?.id ?? msg.interactive?.list_reply?.id ?? null,\n    button_title: msg.button?.text ?? msg.interactive?.button_reply?.title ?? msg.interactive?.list_reply?.title ?? null,\n    reply_to_message_id: msg.context?.id ?? null,\n    media_id: media?.id ?? null,\n    media_mime_type: media?.mime_type ?? null,\n    media_filename: media?.filename ?? null,\n    media_sha256: media?.sha256 ?? null,\n    payload,\n  } };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        704,
        176
      ],
      "id": "ea2c95be-d01a-42e9-8d91-e488cdd0162d",
      "name": "Parse Message",
      "notes": "بيحوّل الويبهوك لصف لكل رسالة: phone / user_id (BSUID) / reply_to / type / content / button_reply / media_id / location... \nدايمًا رد على reply_to (phone ?? user_id) عشان المستخدمين اللي مخفيين رقمهم.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
