      "id": "09bfc18f-00ff-4f57-9847-a10e89d027e4",
      "name": "Event Type",
      "notes": "messages → رسالة من مستخدم. statuses → تحديث حالة رسالة بعتناها إحنا.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const value = $('Webhook').first().json.body?.entry?.[0]?.changes?.[0]?.value;\nconst statuses = value?.statuses ?? [];\nconst contacts = value?.contacts ?? [];\n\n// Meta can send several statuses in one webhook → one item per status\nreturn statuses.map(s => {\n  const contact = contacts.find(c => c.user_id === s.recipient_user_id) ?? contacts[0];\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      wamid: s.id,\n      status: s.status,                 // sent | delivered | read | failed\n      timestamp: Number(s.timestamp),\n      recipient: s.recipient_id,        // phone (or BSUID if phone is hidden)\n      user_id: s.recipient_user_id ?? contact?.user_id ?? null,   // BSUID\n      username: contact?.profile?.username ?? null,\n      error: s.errors?.[0]\n        ? `${s.errors[0].code}: ${s.errors[0].title}${s.errors[0].error_data?.details ? ' — ' + s.errors[0].error_data.details : ''}`\n        : null,\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        688,
        592
      ],
      "id": "419f6115-a9e8-4fd7-8ce5-70a8ac3f4393",
      "name": "Parse Status",
      "notes": "صف لكل status: wamid + sent/delivered/read/failed + وقت + سبب الفشل لو فيه.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "update public.whatsapp_messages\nset status    = $2::text,\n    status_at = to_timestamp($4::bigint),\n    error     = case when $2::text = 'failed' then nullif($3, '') else error end,\n    user_id   = coalesce(user_id, nullif($5, ''))\nwhere wa_message_id = $1\n  and direction = 'outgoing'\n  and (\n    $2::text = 'failed'\n    or coalesce(array_position(array['sent','delivered','read'], status), 0)\n     < array_position(array['sent','delivered','read'], $2::text)\n  )\nreturning id, wa_message_id, status;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.wamid, $json.status, $json.error ?? '', $json.timestamp, $json.user_id ?? '' ] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        912,
        592
      ],
      "id": "892418f7-707f-40e7-b28b-c0507413d6fa",
      "name": "Update WhatsApp Status",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "🔧 Postgres (your DB)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "بيحدّث حالة الرسايل الصادرة (اللي انت سجلتها بنفسك بعد الإرسال). sent → delivered → read ومبيرجعش ورا، failed بيغلب أي حالة.\n🔧 Credential: Postgres بتاعك.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "insert into public.whatsapp_messages\n  (wa_message_id, phone, user_id, direction, message_type, content,\n   button_reply, button_title, raw)\nvalues (\n  $1, nullif($2, ''), nullif($3, ''), 'incoming', $4, nullif($5, ''),\n  nullif($6, ''), nullif($7, ''), $8::jsonb\n)\non conflict (wa_message_id) do nothing\nreturning id;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.message_id, $json.phone ?? '', $json.user_id ?? '', $json.type, $json.content ?? '', $json.button_reply ?? '', $json.button_title ?? '', JSON.stringify($('Webhook').first().json.body) ] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        928,
        176
      ],
      "id": "f42b4669-d4c3-41e8-8fa0-5b2a2fad7407",
      "name": "Log Incoming Message",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "name": "🔧 Postgres (your DB)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "بيسجّل كل رسالة واردة في whatsapp_messages. on conflict do nothing = لو Meta بعتت نفس الرسالة مرتين، مرة واحدة بس تتسجل. $1,$2.. = queryReplacement (مفيش string concatenation في SQL أبدًا).\n🔧 Credential: Postgres بتاعك. الجدول لازم يكون موجود (SQL مرفق مع الورك فلو).",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
